<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>霍乱 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E9%9C%8D%E4%B9%B1/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 13:30:24 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E9%9C%8D%E4%B9%B1/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>饥治法：论伤寒 论虫痛 论霍乱</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-38-jizhifa/</link><pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 09:35:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-38-jizhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“饥治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;伤寒邪退、虫痛、霍乱&lt;/strong&gt;三种须在&lt;strong&gt;空腹饥饿时服药或禁食&lt;/strong&gt;的病症治法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;不可饱食，俟其饥而用药治之。空腹则药力易行、邪气易散、虫体易杀，若饱食则胃气壅闭、邪复聚、虫得养而难除&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>续伤寒篇：辨霍乱病脉证并治</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui-huoluan/</link><pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 10:30:24 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui-huoluan/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E9%87%91%E5%8C%AE/">金匮</category><description>&lt;p&gt;原伤寒论之末篇辨霍乱病脉症并治法，辨阴阳易瘥后劳复脉症，辨痉喝脉症，这三脉症有经方家并列入伤寒之末篇，但又是金匮之始篇，实介于伤寒与金匮之间的连接篇，个人认为伤寒到最末厥阴篇即可止，这最后三篇可置于金匮之首篇，以衔接伤寒与金匮本源于一书伤寒杂病论。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>